  <text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
    <body>

        <div xml:id="AN263.1-kilavi">
          <p type="edition">makaṭpōkkiya tāy colliyatu.</p>
          <p type="translation" xml:lang="en">What the mother said who had let [her] daughter go.</p>
        </div>
        <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="AN263.1">
        <l><anchor n="1"/>tayaṅkutiraip peruṅkaṭa lulakutoḻat tōṉṟi</l>
        <l>vayaṅkukatir virinta vuruvukeḻu maṇṭilaṅ</l>
        <l>kayaṅkaṇ vaṟappap pāay naṉṉilam</l>
        <l>payaṅkeṭat tiru<supplied>ki</supplied>ya yaitaṟu kālai</l>
        <l>vēṟupala kavalaiya veruvaru viyaṉkāṭ</l>
        <l>ṭāṟucel vampalar varutiṟaṅ kāṇmār </l>
        <l>vilva lāṭavar mēlā ḷoṟṟi</l>
        <l><supplied>nī</supplied>ṭunilai yāattuk kōṭuko ḷaruñcuraṅ</l>
        <l>koṇṭaṉaṉ kaḻinta vaṉkaṭ kāḷaik </l>
        <l>kavaṭuṇi vaṟintaṉe ṉāyi ṉaṉṉō</l>
        <l>voḷiṟuvēṟ kōtai yōmpik kākkum</l>
        <l>vañci yaṉṉaveṉ vaḷarnakar viḷaṅka </l>
        <l>viṉitaṉiṟ puṇarkkuveṉ maṉṉō tuṉiyiṉṟu </l>
        <l>tirunutaṟ polintaveṉ pētai</l>
        <l>varumulai muṟṟat teḷi<supplied>ya</supplied> tuyilē.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg type="translation" xml:lang="en">
        <l corresp="4cd">At the time when [all that is] wonderful ceases,</l>
        <l>as the beautiful orb that appeared, while the world [surrounded]</l>
        <l corresp="1f">by the big sea with glittering waves worshipped [it, and] extended [its] glowing rays,</l>
        <l>spread [heat] so that the pond areas dried up [and] wrung out the good ground</l>
        <l corresp="3-4b" rend="indent7">so that the yield was lost,</l>
        <l corresp="5">in the frightening wide wilderness with many different crossroads,</l>
        <l corresp="10">if I had known, alas, her decision</l>
        <l corresp="9">for the strong young man who passed by, taking [her]</l>
        <l corresp="8d">to the difficult desert, where,</l>
        <l corresp="6">in order to see the side where the travellers come who go [that] way,</l>
        <l corresp="7">men mastering the bow, spying for men from above</l>
        <l corresp="8a-c" rend="indent4">take to  the branches of tall-stemmed Yām trees,</l>
        <l corresp="12">while my growing mansion shone like Vañci</l>
        <l corresp="11">that is protectively guarded by Kōtai with a bright spear,</l>
        <l corresp="13">sweetly for sure I would have united [them] without revulsion</l>
        <l corresp="15">[for him to] sleep easily on the expanse of the growing breasts</l>
        <l corresp="16">of my flourishing girl with a luminous forehead.</l>
      </lg>
        </div>
    </body>
  </text>

